      en: ["Commissioned in 2009 as the first community wind project in the region.", "The facility uses a 150 kW refurbished Nordtank turbine from Denmark.", "Supplies electricity to more than 250 households in Batokunku village.", "Funded entirely by private donations and local community contributions.", "Recognized as the first community-run wind power plant in West Africa.", "Excess power is periodically fed into the national NAWEC power grid."],
